ompany-managed **AND** the Security Score \\u00e2\\u2030\\u00a4 50.  \\n     _**This rule now overrides ISP type or novel country location.**_\\n   - OR Usage Type is 'Fixed Line' AND the country has been historically confirmed by the client.\\n   - OR the login originates from a geographically proximate or regionally related country, login time is realistic, Security Score \\u00e2\\u2030\\u00a4 50, and prior client-confirmed activity exists nearby.\\n\\n2. **High Priority (HP)** if none of the LP rules apply, including:\\n   - The login originates from a country with no prior client confirmation AND no regional or temporal plausibility.\\n   - OR Usage Type is 'Data Center/Proxy' or any other type without prior confirmation.\\n   - OR Security Score > 50.\\n   - OR the IP is a VPN BUT the device is **not** company-managed OR the Security Score > 50.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-88\", \"alert_name\": \"User Login Location Anomaly\", \"start_time\": \"2025-07-23T23:55:15.000Z\", \"source_ip\": \"182.95.178.158\", \"destination_ip\": \"13.80.23.7\", \"user\": \"karl.saare@client.ee\", \"user_id\": \"2f6c9d81-4a7b-4e3f-9b0d-6a8e5c1f27d4\", \"description\": \"An anomalous Office 365 login occurred from Mumbai, India, which is outside the user's typical login region.\", \"evidence\": {\"login_type\": \"o365_login\", \"login_result\": \"success\", \"has_mfa\": false, \"user_agent\": \"Windows-AzureAD-Authentication-Provider/1.0\", \"os\": \"Windows\", \"geo_location\": {\"city\": \"Mumbai\", \"country\": \"India\"}}, \"technique\": {\"name\": \"XDR Location Anomaly\", \"killchain_stage\": \"Initial Attempts\"}}"
  }
]

